# ============================================================
# NETLIFY REDIRECTS
# ============================================================
# Netlify serves this repo root exactly as it is committed, so
# every file in the repo is fetchable over HTTP unless a rule
# with a bang shadows it. These rules bounce the files that are
# not meant for the public back to the homepage.
#
# The band documents function holds every Drive link in one
# file. Without the first rule below, anyone could download
# that source at /netlify/functions/roadcase-links.mjs and read
# the lot without signing in. Do not remove it.
#
# The functions themselves are invoked at
# /.netlify/functions/<name>, with a leading dot, which none of
# these rules touch.
#
# Cutover note: DOMAIN-CUTOVER.md Step 4 adds a /home rule to
# this file when the domain moves. Add it above the blocks.
# ============================================================

# Function source, including every band document link.
/netlify/*            /    301!

# The Netlify config files themselves.
/_headers             /    301!
/_redirects           /    301!

# Internal runbook. Lists the GA4 property, the Formspree
# endpoint, and the repo. Not for the public.
/DOMAIN-CUTOVER.md    /    301!
